          "text": "Ngelo Jothamu, na Ahazi, na Hezekia werekoghe wazuri wa Juda, BWANA oreghorieghe na Mika, mundu wa muzi ghwa Moreshethi. BWANA ukamfunukuya malagho agha aighu ya Samaria na Jerusalemu.",
